WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.706
Read the question carefully, list the needed quantities, choose operations in order,

00:00:04.706 --> 00:00:05.832
then check units.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:15.113
First add 20 and 18, then multiply the result by 5. The answer is 190. (20 plus 18)

00:00:15.113 --> 00:00:16.983
times 5 equals 190.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:23.852
A classroom in a recycling club has 32 blue counters and 42 red counters in each box.

00:00:23.852 --> 00:00:28.493
There are 2 boxes. How many counters altogether? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:36.610
A classroom in a recycling club has 32 blue counters and 42 red counters in each box.

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:43.001
There are 2 boxes. How many counters altogether? The answer is 148. (32 plus 42)

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:44.705
times 2 equals 148.
